00:22:29.709 --> 00:22:30.949
and we were so excited.

00:22:30.949 --> 00:22:33.930
Of course, ended up staying
up to like 2:00 a.m.,

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:37.407
that's not something that
I do, I'm no elf (laughs),

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:41.030
but I did it, 'cause we were excited.

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:44.750
So then we get down there and we're like,

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:48.210
Lando came up to our bedroom
first before he went in there

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:52.910
and he got, he woke Lily
up, I mean, she's 15,

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.107
turns out, by the time you turn 15,

00:22:55.107 --> 00:22:57.340
if you don't have to go to school,

00:22:57.340 --> 00:22:59.420
you could literally sleep.

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:01.040
- Into the afternoon.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.050
- For days.

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:03.320
- Yeah, of course.

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:04.620
- I don't know, if we don't wake her up,

00:23:04.620 --> 00:23:08.610
I just don't when she
would ever wake up and

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:10.610
Lincoln knew that he was
getting an electric guitar,

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:14.130
so he wasn't too motivated
to get out of bed either.

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:16.230
So we get them out of
bed and we're like, okay,

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:17.891
go in there and get the presents

00:23:17.891 --> 00:23:19.040
and then we're like watching
and they go in there

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.830
and they're, you know,
it's, ah, joke's on you,

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:24.010
the presents aren't here and they're like,

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:25.890
kind of groggy and they're like, well,

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:28.090
and then Lando's the most
excited, I mean, he's eight

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.920
and he's like opening the
card and they're reading

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:33.733
