have been a little more,

00:24:00.575 --> 00:24:03.395
maybe you should have
analyzed it a little bit more.

00:24:03.395 --> 00:24:04.228
- Oh, I thought you
said maybe I should have

00:24:04.228 --> 00:24:05.061
been a little more animated.

00:24:05.061 --> 00:24:06.325
- No, no, no.

00:24:06.325 --> 00:24:07.158
- I'm like, dude, I was animated.

00:24:07.158 --> 00:24:09.230
I was like, scavenger hunt, guys!

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:10.680
Yeah!

00:24:10.680 --> 00:24:13.370
- So what ended up happening?

00:24:13.370 --> 00:24:16.790
- Well, they had to solve the
riddles to get their presents.

00:24:16.790 --> 00:24:20.060
So then, so by the time they
found the third present,

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:22.360
they were waking up more,
it was kind of like,

00:24:23.590 --> 00:24:27.290
there's like a delayed
reaction of the scavenger hunt.

00:24:28.260 --> 00:24:30.650
You get to your third
clue, it's like an infusion

00:24:30.650 --> 00:24:31.530
of caffeine.

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:33.300
They kind of got onboard.

00:24:33.300 --> 00:24:34.840
- In my experience, scavenger hunts,

00:24:34.840 --> 00:24:37.590
really hot out of the gate,
you know what I'm saying

00:24:37.590 --> 00:24:38.763
and only go downhill from there.

00:24:38.763 --> 00:24:41.280
- I think that they
saw the look on my face

00:24:41.280 --> 00:24:44.870
of disappointment and
still hope and expectation

00:24:44.870 --> 00:24:47.400
that this like, let's
just do this for Dad.

00:24:47.400 --> 00:24:49.270
- Yeah, wow, okay, so,

00:24:49.270 --> 00:24:50.711
is this a tradition now?

00:24:50.711 --> 00:24:53.630
- But they got into it and
when they found the presents,

00:24:53.630 --> 00:24:55.820
they were still wrapped, by the way.

00:24:55.820 --> 00:24:56.730
- Well yeah, of course.

00:24:56.730 --> 00:24:58.467
- So then they would, they
would take the presents

00:24:58.467 --> 00:25:01.210
