00:25:06.130 --> 00:25:07.257
Do you have to follow the clues, 'cause--

00:25:07.257 --> 00:25:08.849
- You gotta follow the clues.

00:25:08.849 --> 00:25:11.230
- But you know, oh, maybe
one's in the washing machine.

00:25:11.230 --> 00:25:12.850
- I think there were 10,

00:25:12.850 --> 00:25:14.830
there were 10 locations, okay?

00:25:14.830 --> 00:25:15.663
- Total?

00:25:15.663 --> 00:25:16.716
- Yeah, total.

00:25:16.716 --> 00:25:18.085
- They worked as a team to
get everyone's presents.

00:25:18.085 --> 00:25:19.010
- They worked as a team,
so each location would

00:25:19.010 --> 00:25:21.190
have multiple presents,
like one for each kid

00:25:21.190 --> 00:25:22.970
kind of a thing and

00:25:24.183 --> 00:25:26.030
so they came around to it
and then I really think

00:25:26.030 --> 00:25:31.030
it's about, now next year,
yes, it is a tradition,

00:25:31.310 --> 00:25:34.390
we are gonna do it and
they're gonna be emotionally

00:25:34.390 --> 00:25:35.693
prepared.

00:25:35.693 --> 00:25:37.017
