00:25:41.261 --> 00:25:42.094
You don't think?

00:25:42.094 --> 00:25:46.203
My clues were lit, like a tree, man.

00:25:47.740 --> 00:25:48.640
So we're gonna do that.

00:25:48.640 --> 00:25:51.570
