00:44:55.370 --> 00:44:58.590
You know, like you tell
the story of the time

00:44:58.590 --> 00:45:00.979
the whole house got smoked up and then

00:45:00.979 --> 00:45:04.790
400 years later, there's
a dude with incense,

00:45:04.790 --> 00:45:08.830
he's like, we light this incense in honor

00:45:08.830 --> 00:45:12.360
of the time Rhett and Jessie McLaughlin

00:45:12.360 --> 00:45:13.760
nearly burned their house down,

00:45:13.760 --> 00:45:15.090
like that's how traditions start,

00:45:15.090 --> 00:45:16.815
it's always something stupid.

00:45:16.815 --> 00:45:18.743
